 a host of seemingly diverse interests and gave them a common theme.  The
 Extropaganza will be held starting at 2:00 p.m. at my house in Boulder Creek
 California.  This note will hopefully provide all you need to know in order
 to make this an event worth remembering.  Included are 1) description of
 comestables, 2) directions and (alas) 3) rules.  

 1) Comestables

 We have decided to provide a rather substantial spread, which seems to be
 the concensus among the respondants to my little survey.  The food will
 be partly prepared by a local restaurant (The Boulder Creek Brewing Co),
 and partly by my wife and I.  The main food we will serve is a variety
 of quiches which includes one or two vegetarian (although clearly not
 vegan) types and one or two meat types.  Also provided will be a couple
 of different pasta salads and a green salad.  This food will be picked up
 from the restaurant at about 5:00 p.m. and should last a while, but is (of 
