 a buffet consisting of deli coldcuts and cheese, a variety of breads, 
 fresh vegetables, crackers, and the typical snarf-all-you-want,we'll-make-more
 fare.  If there is nothing on this menu that you can or will eat, let me
 know as soon as possible -- it's late but we'll try to provide something 
