 For libations, we will be getting a keg of beer.  This beer is likely to
 be Red Hook ESB or some similar, since Boulder Creek Brewing Co wants 
 $200 a keg (yowwch!).  I am reserving the keg as of tomorrow, so any
 recommendations for alternatives will only be considered if received by
 tomorrow morning.  In addition to the beer, we will provide several jugs
 of wine of rather generic nature.  For non-alchohol drinkers and those
 desiring to moderate their alchohol consumption, we will also provide
 sodas and fruit juices.  Suggestions for "smart drinks" (hate that appellation)
 are requested.

