 From the North (San Francisco, Marin, San Mateo, etc)

 Take 101 or 280 south to the 85 W exit (aka Saratoga-Sunnyvale Rd)
 proceed west into Saratoga, and the intersection with Highway 9.
 Turn R on 9, proceed 26 miles to town of Boulder Creek.
 Observe the Boulder Creek Fire Department on your Left and a large neon
 sign proclaiming "Johnnie's Super" on your Right.  Take first R past 
